  <!-- ===================================================================
       The pebbles: river stones set in grout, for edging paths outdoors. Stone
       only, and like the vine four one-tile variants, so a path's edge never
       repeats on a beat.

       The defNames say Pebbles, not Pebble, for the same reason. As
       NE_PebbleBorder, the end cap's Frame_ took Jade's slot on a 229-mod
       list, and every deep jade deposit in a save made before the update
       would have read as that frame.
